Hi guys,

I am new to R, and I am building precisely what is being discussed
here. Any chance somebody can give me a pointer on how I can overcome
this basic problem:

given the following R code:

library(rjson)
x <- c(3:5)
toJSON(x)

#it produces invalid JSON:

[1] "[3,4,5]"

#when I am expecting something like:

"[3,4,5]"

I am a new to R, I guess this is something easy to do, but I had have
no luck finding a solution, any help/pointers would be greatly
appreciated

